<h1>Operations and troubleshooting</h1>
<p class="lede">Day-to-day operations, updates, backups and common problems.</p>

<h2 id="commands">Everyday commands</h2>
<table>
    <thead><tr><th>Task</th><th>Command</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>Status</td><td><code>docker compose ps</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Logs</td><td>OpenObserve: <code>http://&lt;server&gt;:5080</code> (<a href="#logs">below</a>) or <code>docker compose logs -f booster-idp</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Stop (data is kept)</td><td><code>docker compose down</code></td></tr>
